From d8d78f25fd4fd42fd93892e5723b6ece60e09806 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 18:43:24 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Video full screen: restore portrait when leaving full
 screen

The full-screen effect's onDispose read videoFullscreen, which had already
flipped to false on exit, so the saved orientation was never restored and the
app stayed locked to landscape until restart. Capture whether full screen was
entered when the effect starts and use that in onDispose.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EzyBeBJGG55RsMKWmRWTnP
